# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test): a tap, a fling
# and a long press on the touch surface (220x120 at (10, 58) on testbench_rp2350's
# 320x240 window), each through GestureDetector.onTouchEvent.
wait \[layout\] fit ok
sleep 1
input tap 120 118
wait GestureDemo[]:] tap
input swipe 40 118 200 118 150
wait GestureDemo[]:] fling right
input swipe 120 118 120 118 1200
